        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Point is an arcade-inspired VR first person shooter, filled with Warioware-style minigames. Think, aim, and blast your way to a high score through over 100 shooting minigames, but don't hit those bombs or you'll run out of lives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/46f46d5ab34700cccdc6056ba4b228ed.poster.avif?t=1766066724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/46f46d5ab34700cccdc6056ba4b228ed.webm?t=1766066724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/46f46d5ab34700cccdc6056ba4b228ed.mp4?t=1766066724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u></u><br><u>ABOUT</u>   </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in over 100 arcade-style target shooting minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Tickets and Unlock new Minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calibrate, Chill, Expert, One-off, and Marathon modes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local, global, and friends leaderboards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run riot through wacky arcade worlds. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive VR experience, tuned for all experience and comfort levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various accessibility options to tune comfort and difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/e55b5c5286d123943d5abf187b0d1559.poster.avif?t=1766066724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/e55b5c5286d123943d5abf187b0d1559.webm?t=1766066724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/e55b5c5286d123943d5abf187b0d1559.mp4?t=1766066724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><u>GAME MODES</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calibrate: </strong>New tutorial level to get you started. After completing calibration, you'll start earning Arcade Tickets (while playing in Chill or Expert mode). Use your tickets to unlock new mini-games and game modes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill: </strong>Learn the ropes in some of the key types of mini-games, or just practice without much pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expert: </strong>Up the stakes with a huge variety of more difficult mini-games that you’ll need to unlock as you progress. Similar to the classic arcade-style gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Off Mode (NEW): </strong>Play individual mini-games to hone your skills and strive for S Rank on everything. Unlock more minigames here with your Arcade Tickets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marathon Mode (NEW): </strong>Oops - all mini-games! Yep, every single one of them, in a row. Can you unlock this challenge, and make it through all 115? This is the ultimate test of accuracy and endurance: stretch your trigger fingers, loosen up your arms, make sure that headset is fully charged, and stay hydrated! (please play within your limits). </p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Point is an arcade-inspired VR first person shooter, filled with Warioware-style minigames. Think, aim, and blast your way to a high score through over 100 shooting minigames, but don't hit those bombs or you'll run out of lives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/46f46d5ab34700cccdc6056ba4b228ed.poster.avif?t=1766066724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/46f46d5ab34700cccdc6056ba4b228ed.webm?t=1766066724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/46f46d5ab34700cccdc6056ba4b228ed.mp4?t=1766066724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u></u><br><u>ABOUT</u>   </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in over 100 arcade-style target shooting minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Tickets and Unlock new Minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calibrate, Chill, Expert, One-off, and Marathon modes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local, global, and friends leaderboards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run riot through wacky arcade worlds. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive VR experience, tuned for all experience and comfort levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various accessibility options to tune comfort and difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/e55b5c5286d123943d5abf187b0d1559.poster.avif?t=1766066724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/e55b5c5286d123943d5abf187b0d1559.webm?t=1766066724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/e55b5c5286d123943d5abf187b0d1559.mp4?t=1766066724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><u>GAME MODES</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calibrate: </strong>New tutorial level to get you started. After completing calibration, you'll start earning Arcade Tickets (while playing in Chill or Expert mode). Use your tickets to unlock new mini-games and game modes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill: </strong>Learn the ropes in some of the key types of mini-games, or just practice without much pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expert: </strong>Up the stakes with a huge variety of more difficult mini-games that you’ll need to unlock as you progress. Similar to the classic arcade-style gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Off Mode (NEW): </strong>Play individual mini-games to hone your skills and strive for S Rank on everything. Unlock more minigames here with your Arcade Tickets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marathon Mode (NEW): </strong>Oops - all mini-games! Yep, every single one of them, in a row. Can you unlock this challenge, and make it through all 115? This is the ultimate test of accuracy and endurance: stretch your trigger fingers, loosen up your arms, make sure that headset is fully charged, and stay hydrated! (please play within your limits). </p></li></ul>",
